    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"The Entrepreneurial 3-Pointer\"\nsubtitle: \"Why starting a business is like shooting from deep\"\nauthor:\n  - name: \"King Matayo\"\n    email: kingmatayo.thefirst@gmail.com\ndate: 12/21/2024\nimage: \"../assets/images/business.jpg\"\ncategories: [Appendix, Business, Strategy]\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n> *\"I'm not afraid to take it. I've been shooting that shot my whole life.\"* – Stephen Curry\n\n## The Shot No One Wanted\n\nIn the early 2000s, the three-point shot was considered risky. Teams used it sparingly, as a last resort. The conventional wisdom was clear: get closer to the basket for a \"better\" shot.\n\nThen Stephen Curry arrived. He didn't just take three-pointers—he built his entire game around them. What was once considered reckless became revolutionary.\n\n**Entrepreneurship follows a similar path.** What seems crazy to conventional wisdom often becomes the next paradigm shift.\n\n## The Risk-Reward Calculation\n\nA three-pointer is worth 50% more than a two-pointer. If you shoot 35% from three, you score 1.05 points per attempt. To match that efficiency from two-point range, you'd need to shoot 52.5%.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"highchart html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-ea7ed2186d95cf981415\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-ea7ed2186d95cf981415\">{\"x\":{\"hc_opts\":{\"chart\":{\"reflow\":true,\"type\":\"column\"},\"title\":{\"text\":\"Stephen Curry: Three-Point Evolution\"},\"yAxis\":[{\"title\":{\"text\":\"Attempts\"}},{\"title\":{\"text\":\"FG%\"},\"opposite\":true,\"max\":50}],\"credits\":{\"enabled\":false},\"exporting\":{\"enabled\":false},\"boost\":{\"enabled\":false},\"plotOptions\":{\"series\":{\"label\":{\"enabled\":false},\"turboThreshold\":0},\"treemap\":{\"layoutAlgorithm\":\"squarified\"}},\"subtitle\":{\"text\":\"Volume and efficiency over time\"},\"xAxis\":{\"categories\":[]},\"series\":[{\"data\":[],\"name\":\"3PT Attempts\",\"color\":\"#1D428A\",\"type\":\"column\"},{\"data\":[],\"name\":\"3PT%\",\"color\":\"#FDB927\",\"type\":\"spline\",\"yAxis\":1}]},\"theme\":{\"colors\":[\"#f1c40f\",\"#2ecc71\",\"#9b59b6\",\"#e74c3c\",\"#34495e\",\"#3498db\",\"#1abc9c\",\"#f39c12\",\"#d35400\"],\"chart\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#34495e\"},\"xAxis\":{\"gridLineDashStyle\":\"Dash\",\"gridLineWidth\":1,\"gridLineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"lineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"minorGridLineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"tickColor\":\"#46627f\",\"tickWidth\":1,\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}},\"yAxis\":{\"gridLineDashStyle\":\"Dash\",\"gridLineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"lineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"minorGridLineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"tickColor\":\"#46627f\",\"tickWidth\":1,\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}},\"legendBackgroundColor\":\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)\",\"background2\":\"#505053\",\"dataLabelsColor\":\"#B0B0B3\",\"textColor\":\"#34495e\",\"contrastTextColor\":\"#F0F0F3\",\"maskColor\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\",\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}},\"subtitle\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#666666\"}},\"legend\":{\"itemStyle\":{\"color\":\"#C0C0C0\"},\"itemHoverStyle\":{\"color\":\"#C0C0C0\"},\"itemHiddenStyle\":{\"color\":\"#444444\"}}},\"conf_opts\":{\"global\":{\"Date\":null,\"VMLRadialGradientURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/gfx/vml-radial-gradient.png\",\"canvasToolsURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/modules/canvas-tools.js\",\"getTimezoneOffset\":null,\"timezoneOffset\":0,\"useUTC\":true},\"lang\":{\"contextButtonTitle\":\"Chart context menu\",\"decimalPoint\":\".\",\"downloadCSV\":\"Download CSV\",\"downloadJPEG\":\"Download JPEG image\",\"downloadPDF\":\"Download PDF document\",\"downloadPNG\":\"Download PNG image\",\"downloadSVG\":\"Download SVG vector image\",\"downloadXLS\":\"Download XLS\",\"drillUpText\":\"◁ Back to {series.name}\",\"exitFullscreen\":\"Exit from full screen\",\"exportData\":{\"annotationHeader\":\"Annotations\",\"categoryDatetimeHeader\":\"DateTime\",\"categoryHeader\":\"Category\"},\"hideData\":\"Hide data table\",\"invalidDate\":null,\"loading\":\"Loading...\",\"months\":[\"January\",\"February\",\"March\",\"April\",\"May\",\"June\",\"July\",\"August\",\"September\",\"October\",\"November\",\"December\"],\"noData\":\"No data to display\",\"numericSymbolMagnitude\":1000,\"numericSymbols\":[\"k\",\"M\",\"G\",\"T\",\"P\",\"E\"],\"printChart\":\"Print chart\",\"resetZoom\":\"Reset zoom\",\"resetZoomTitle\":\"Reset zoom level 1:1\",\"shortMonths\":[\"Jan\",\"Feb\",\"Mar\",\"Apr\",\"May\",\"Jun\",\"Jul\",\"Aug\",\"Sep\",\"Oct\",\"Nov\",\"Dec\"],\"shortWeekdays\":[\"Sat\",\"Sun\",\"Mon\",\"Tue\",\"Wed\",\"Thu\",\"Fri\"],\"thousandsSep\":\" \",\"viewData\":\"View data table\",\"viewFullscreen\":\"View in full screen\",\"weekdays\":[\"Sunday\",\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\",\"Thursday\",\"Friday\",\"Saturday\"]}},\"type\":\"chart\",\"fonts\":[],\"debug\":false},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n\nCurry's three-point volume AND efficiency revolutionized the game\n:::\n:::\n\n\nSimilarly, entrepreneurship offers asymmetric returns. Most startups fail, but successful ones can return 10x, 100x, or even 1000x the initial investment.\n\n## The Failure Rate\n\nHere's the uncomfortable truth about startups:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"highchart html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-10c93930f1f6252d401f\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-10c93930f1f6252d401f\">{\"x\":{\"hc_opts\":{\"chart\":{\"reflow\":true,\"type\":\"areaspline\"},\"title\":{\"text\":\"Startup Survival Rates\"},\"yAxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"% Still Operating\"},\"max\":100},\"credits\":{\"enabled\":false},\"exporting\":{\"enabled\":false},\"boost\":{\"enabled\":false},\"plotOptions\":{\"series\":{\"label\":{\"enabled\":false},\"turboThreshold\":0},\"treemap\":{\"layoutAlgorithm\":\"squarified\"}},\"subtitle\":{\"text\":\"The odds are against you—just like a contested three-pointer\"},\"xAxis\":{\"categories\":[\"Year 1\",\"Year 2\",\"Year 3\",\"Year 5\",\"Year 10\"]},\"series\":[{\"data\":[80,70,60,50,30],\"name\":\"Survival Rate\",\"color\":\"#e94560\",\"fillOpacity\":0.3}]},\"theme\":{\"colors\":[\"#f1c40f\",\"#2ecc71\",\"#9b59b6\",\"#e74c3c\",\"#34495e\",\"#3498db\",\"#1abc9c\",\"#f39c12\",\"#d35400\"],\"chart\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#34495e\"},\"xAxis\":{\"gridLineDashStyle\":\"Dash\",\"gridLineWidth\":1,\"gridLineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"lineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"minorGridLineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"tickColor\":\"#46627f\",\"tickWidth\":1,\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}},\"yAxis\":{\"gridLineDashStyle\":\"Dash\",\"gridLineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"lineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"minorGridLineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"tickColor\":\"#46627f\",\"tickWidth\":1,\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}},\"legendBackgroundColor\":\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)\",\"background2\":\"#505053\",\"dataLabelsColor\":\"#B0B0B3\",\"textColor\":\"#34495e\",\"contrastTextColor\":\"#F0F0F3\",\"maskColor\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\",\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}},\"subtitle\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#666666\"}},\"legend\":{\"itemStyle\":{\"color\":\"#C0C0C0\"},\"itemHoverStyle\":{\"color\":\"#C0C0C0\"},\"itemHiddenStyle\":{\"color\":\"#444444\"}}},\"conf_opts\":{\"global\":{\"Date\":null,\"VMLRadialGradientURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/gfx/vml-radial-gradient.png\",\"canvasToolsURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/modules/canvas-tools.js\",\"getTimezoneOffset\":null,\"timezoneOffset\":0,\"useUTC\":true},\"lang\":{\"contextButtonTitle\":\"Chart context menu\",\"decimalPoint\":\".\",\"downloadCSV\":\"Download CSV\",\"downloadJPEG\":\"Download JPEG image\",\"downloadPDF\":\"Download PDF document\",\"downloadPNG\":\"Download PNG image\",\"downloadSVG\":\"Download SVG vector image\",\"downloadXLS\":\"Download XLS\",\"drillUpText\":\"◁ Back to {series.name}\",\"exitFullscreen\":\"Exit from full screen\",\"exportData\":{\"annotationHeader\":\"Annotations\",\"categoryDatetimeHeader\":\"DateTime\",\"categoryHeader\":\"Category\"},\"hideData\":\"Hide data table\",\"invalidDate\":null,\"loading\":\"Loading...\",\"months\":[\"January\",\"February\",\"March\",\"April\",\"May\",\"June\",\"July\",\"August\",\"September\",\"October\",\"November\",\"December\"],\"noData\":\"No data to display\",\"numericSymbolMagnitude\":1000,\"numericSymbols\":[\"k\",\"M\",\"G\",\"T\",\"P\",\"E\"],\"printChart\":\"Print chart\",\"resetZoom\":\"Reset zoom\",\"resetZoomTitle\":\"Reset zoom level 1:1\",\"shortMonths\":[\"Jan\",\"Feb\",\"Mar\",\"Apr\",\"May\",\"Jun\",\"Jul\",\"Aug\",\"Sep\",\"Oct\",\"Nov\",\"Dec\"],\"shortWeekdays\":[\"Sat\",\"Sun\",\"Mon\",\"Tue\",\"Wed\",\"Thu\",\"Fri\"],\"thousandsSep\":\" \",\"viewData\":\"View data table\",\"viewFullscreen\":\"View in full screen\",\"weekdays\":[\"Sunday\",\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\",\"Thursday\",\"Friday\",\"Saturday\"]}},\"type\":\"chart\",\"fonts\":[],\"debug\":false},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n\nMost startups don't survive—but that doesn't mean you shouldn't try\n:::\n:::\n\n\nStephen Curry misses roughly 57% of his three-point attempts. But he keeps shooting because he understands expected value. Entrepreneurs must embrace the same mindset.\n\n## Practice Makes Permanent\n\nCurry doesn't just shoot—he trains with obsessive precision. His pre-game routine includes hundreds of shots from spots he'll likely never use in the game. Why? Because when the moment comes, execution must be automatic.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"highchart html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-e7f204c35c2db49c5a55\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-e7f204c35c2db49c5a55\">{\"x\":{\"hc_opts\":{\"chart\":{\"reflow\":true,\"type\":\"areaspline\"},\"title\":{\"text\":\"League-Wide Three-Point Revolution\"},\"yAxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"% of Shots from 3PT\"},\"min\":20,\"max\":45},\"credits\":{\"enabled\":false},\"exporting\":{\"enabled\":false},\"boost\":{\"enabled\":false},\"plotOptions\":{\"series\":{\"label\":{\"enabled\":false},\"turboThreshold\":0},\"treemap\":{\"layoutAlgorithm\":\"squarified\"}},\"subtitle\":{\"text\":\"Percentage of all shots from three-point range\"},\"xAxis\":{\"categories\":[2010,2011,2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024]},\"series\":[{\"data\":[22.9,21.9,18.4,26.3,26.9,31.3,33.2,37.4,34.6,31.8,32.7,33,35.5,32.1,32.6],\"name\":\"3PT Rate\",\"color\":\"#1D428A\",\"fillOpacity\":0.3}]},\"theme\":{\"colors\":[\"#f1c40f\",\"#2ecc71\",\"#9b59b6\",\"#e74c3c\",\"#34495e\",\"#3498db\",\"#1abc9c\",\"#f39c12\",\"#d35400\"],\"chart\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#34495e\"},\"xAxis\":{\"gridLineDashStyle\":\"Dash\",\"gridLineWidth\":1,\"gridLineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"lineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"minorGridLineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"tickColor\":\"#46627f\",\"tickWidth\":1,\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}},\"yAxis\":{\"gridLineDashStyle\":\"Dash\",\"gridLineColor\":\"#46627f\",\"lineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"minorGridLineColor\":\"#BDC3C7\",\"tickColor\":\"#46627f\",\"tickWidth\":1,\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}},\"legendBackgroundColor\":\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)\",\"background2\":\"#505053\",\"dataLabelsColor\":\"#B0B0B3\",\"textColor\":\"#34495e\",\"contrastTextColor\":\"#F0F0F3\",\"maskColor\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\",\"title\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"}},\"subtitle\":{\"style\":{\"color\":\"#666666\"}},\"legend\":{\"itemStyle\":{\"color\":\"#C0C0C0\"},\"itemHoverStyle\":{\"color\":\"#C0C0C0\"},\"itemHiddenStyle\":{\"color\":\"#444444\"}}},\"conf_opts\":{\"global\":{\"Date\":null,\"VMLRadialGradientURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/gfx/vml-radial-gradient.png\",\"canvasToolsURL\":\"http =//code.highcharts.com/list(version)/modules/canvas-tools.js\",\"getTimezoneOffset\":null,\"timezoneOffset\":0,\"useUTC\":true},\"lang\":{\"contextButtonTitle\":\"Chart context menu\",\"decimalPoint\":\".\",\"downloadCSV\":\"Download CSV\",\"downloadJPEG\":\"Download JPEG image\",\"downloadPDF\":\"Download PDF document\",\"downloadPNG\":\"Download PNG image\",\"downloadSVG\":\"Download SVG vector image\",\"downloadXLS\":\"Download XLS\",\"drillUpText\":\"◁ Back to {series.name}\",\"exitFullscreen\":\"Exit from full screen\",\"exportData\":{\"annotationHeader\":\"Annotations\",\"categoryDatetimeHeader\":\"DateTime\",\"categoryHeader\":\"Category\"},\"hideData\":\"Hide data table\",\"invalidDate\":null,\"loading\":\"Loading...\",\"months\":[\"January\",\"February\",\"March\",\"April\",\"May\",\"June\",\"July\",\"August\",\"September\",\"October\",\"November\",\"December\"],\"noData\":\"No data to display\",\"numericSymbolMagnitude\":1000,\"numericSymbols\":[\"k\",\"M\",\"G\",\"T\",\"P\",\"E\"],\"printChart\":\"Print chart\",\"resetZoom\":\"Reset zoom\",\"resetZoomTitle\":\"Reset zoom level 1:1\",\"shortMonths\":[\"Jan\",\"Feb\",\"Mar\",\"Apr\",\"May\",\"Jun\",\"Jul\",\"Aug\",\"Sep\",\"Oct\",\"Nov\",\"Dec\"],\"shortWeekdays\":[\"Sat\",\"Sun\",\"Mon\",\"Tue\",\"Wed\",\"Thu\",\"Fri\"],\"thousandsSep\":\" \",\"viewData\":\"View data table\",\"viewFullscreen\":\"View in full screen\",\"weekdays\":[\"Sunday\",\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\",\"Thursday\",\"Friday\",\"Saturday\"]}},\"type\":\"chart\",\"fonts\":[],\"debug\":false},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n\nThe entire NBA followed Curry's lead\n:::\n:::\n\n\nSimilarly, successful entrepreneurs don't wing it. They study markets obsessively, test ideas relentlessly, and build skills before they're needed.\n\n## The Courage to Take the Shot\n\nThe hardest part of shooting a three-pointer isn't the physical act—it's the decision to take it. The same is true for entrepreneurship. The mechanics of starting a business can be learned. The courage to try cannot be taught.\n\n| Three-Point Shooting | Entrepreneurship |\n|---------------------|------------------|\n| 33% success rate | ~10% startup survival |\n| 50% more valuable than 2PT | 10-100x potential returns |\n| Requires practice | Requires preparation |\n| Fear of missing | Fear of failure |\n| Game-changing when hot | Industry-disrupting when successful |\n\n::: {.callout-tip}\n## Lessons for Entrepreneurs\n\n1. **Expected value matters more than success rate** - High-risk, high-reward strategies can be optimal\n2. **Practice creates confidence** - Preparation enables action when opportunity arrives\n3. **First movers reshape markets** - Curry changed how the entire league plays\n4. **Keep shooting** - Missing is part of the process\n5. **Build for the long term** - Curry's success came from years of development\n:::\n\n## The Contagious Effect\n\nWhen Curry proved the three-pointer worked, the entire NBA followed. Teams that clung to mid-range strategies found themselves at a competitive disadvantage.\n\nThe same happens in business. When one company proves a new model works—think Uber, Airbnb, or Netflix—the entire industry must adapt or become obsolete.\n\n**The question isn't whether to take the shot. It's whether you're willing to miss enough times to eventually make it.**\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- Ries, E. (2011). *The Lean Startup*. Crown Business.\n- Thompson, M. (2017). *Golden: The Miraculous Rise of Steph Curry*. Touchstone.\n- Startup survival statistics from Bureau of Labor Statistics and CB Insights\n",
